                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "58243a22-e627-3cd8-99ef-aa5a5a88908a",
                        "entry_id": "4f154d4b-bdc0-39d8-b2b0-f6c28d15a254",
                        "glosses": [
                            "female equivalent of привере́дник (priverédnik): female fastidious, fussy person"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine",
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c3e54eee-a976-4658-948a-7e281357daa5",
                                "sense_id": "58243a22-e627-3cd8-99ef-aa5a5a88908a",
                                "text": "Есть тут, говоря́т, хоро́шая кни́жка одна́ и весьма́ высо́ким сло́гом напи́санная; говоря́т, что хороша́, я сам не чита́л, а здесь о́чень хва́лят. Я проси́л её для себя́; обеща́лись препроводи́ть. То́лько бу́дете ли вы́-то чита́ть? Вы у меня́ на э́тот счёт привере́дница; тру́дно угоди́ть на ваш вкус[...].",
                                "translation": "I am told there is a good book here written in very fine language; they say it is good, I have not read it myself, but it is very much praised here. I have asked for it and they have promised to lend it me, only will you read it? You are so hard to please in that line; it is difficult to satisfy your taste….",
                                "english": "I am told there is a good book here written in very fine language; they say it is good, I have not read it myself, but it is very much praised here. I have asked for it and they have promised to lend it me, only will you read it? You are so hard to please in that line; it is difficult to satisfy your taste…."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
